  "description": "Introducing Mossy, a sweetly rounded font with a playful graffiti-inspired touch and distinctive letterforms. Mossy effortlessly merges casual flair with a retro aesthetic, making it perfect for bold, attention-grabbing designs like posters and flyers.\nThe uppercase letters in Mossy feature a dynamic graffiti style, adding an edgy and urban vibe to your designs. Meanwhile, the lowercase letters showcase a soft and gentle sans-serif design, providing a harmonious contrast and ensuring readability.\nOffered in both filled and outline styles, Mossy provides versatility for various design needs. With comprehensive multilingual support, numbers, and punctuation, Mossy stands as a versatile and characterful font for any creative project.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Introducing Mossy, a sweetly rounded font with a playful graffiti-inspired touch and distinctive letterforms. Mossy effortlessly merges casual flair with a retro aesthetic, making it perfect for bold, attention-grabbing designs like posters and flyers.</p>\n<p>The uppercase letters in Mossy feature a dynamic graffiti style, adding an edgy and urban vibe to your designs. Meanwhile, the lowercase letters showcase a soft and gentle sans-serif design, providing a harmonious contrast and ensuring readability.</p>\n<p>Offered in both filled and outline styles, Mossy provides versatility for various design needs. With comprehensive multilingual support, numbers, and punctuation, Mossy stands as a versatile and characterful font for any creative project.</p>",
